  data: {
    LLM: "Protect your 9s and Aces. Since the 9 is worth 5 points, capturing even one is a huge boost. Avoid leading trumps if you are weak.\n\nThe 'Delegar' Logic: Only delegate to your partner if your hand is perfectly balanced with no strong suits. If you have five cards of one suit, always name it trumps yourself.\n\nManaging the 'Contrar': Doubling is a psychological tool. Use it not just when you have trumps, but when you suspect the dealer delegated because they have a terrible hand.",
    Player: "Protect your 9s and Aces. Since the 9 is worth 5 points, capturing even one is a huge boost. Avoid leading trumps if you are weak.\n\nThe 'Delegar' Logic: Only delegate to your partner if your hand is perfectly balanced with no strong suits. If you have five cards of one suit, always name it trumps yourself.\n\nManaging the 'Contrar': Doubling is a psychological tool. Use it not just when you have trumps, but when you suspect the dealer delegated because they have a terrible hand.",
